data=col4,<col=ffffff>4.5%</col> chance per rank on being hit that protection prayers will work at <col=ffffff>100%</col> (or <col=ffffff>75%</col> in PvP) for 3 seconds. This does not stack with devoted.<br><col=0x7592A0>This perk has an increased chance to activate on level 20 items.</col>
data=col6,2
